{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "63431cd894716feee5d29efff8ad6c1a55bdeade233587d11f6db26c912617fb", "ja": "コスメの試作品が完成し、メイクに挑戦。育\nは母親を見て覚えたという知識を披露、桃子\nは思うところある様子だったが、普段通りの\n環に元気をもらう。やがて環の変身ぶりに、\n育も焦りの表情を見せるのだった。", "zh": "化妆品试作品完成后，大家开始挑战化妆。育展示了自己看着妈妈学习到的化妆知识，桃子虽然似乎若有所思，却也被一如既往的环鼓舞了起来。很快，看到环焕然一新的模样，育也露出了焦急的表情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b0c21e5408d3b97ed424988c341c6a25bbbc8c99e01575b2ce233b1c10428d3b", "ja": "（プチプラコスメの試作品ができたとの事で、\n3人を連れてブランドのサロンへとやってきた）", "zh": "（听说平价彩妆的试用品已经做好了，于是我带着3人来到了品牌沙龙。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b6908c0617a37b9fe9d9a88d5cadaa0a63a9cb761fb46ce35091e0b2e4d8fbf4", "ja": "3人とも、洗顔して、化粧水もつけ終わったか？\nひとまず、準備完了だな！", "zh": "你们3个，洗完脸、爽肤水也涂好了吗？\n总之，准备工作完成啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "0b8b359678a1448abf947d207af7ef93445fdc41984f40967a68815ced6ccc9e", "ja": "化粧水は、お仕事でメイクする時も使うけど。\nなんかいつもより、顔がぷるぷるしてる気がする……。", "zh": "化妆水工作化妆时也会用。\n总觉得脸比平时更水嫩了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "8106e699add8d34b5b2f925c90d0cfdf19c42373ed82089bc02ac12bdbec1185", "ja": "あのね、水分と油分は大事なんだって、\nおかあさんが言ってたよ！", "zh": "那个，妈妈说过，水分和油分都很重要哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "bba90006db1d51698c1f79088c6e0ed464fed7c200a1ebd0fd99df5a6d9e2725", "ja": "お肌が手に吸いつくくらいが、\nお化粧するにはいいんだって！", "zh": "听说皮肤要滋润到能吸住手，这样化妆才好哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "97baae73a4cdcccbe598edc8520eb81ec36e13ad302b8e5437980b6bd46b7a01", "ja": "おやぶん、たまきのほっぺた触ってー！\nもちもちだぞ～！", "zh": "大将，摸摸环的脸蛋嘛——！\n软乎乎的哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c98a8547c4746a906ca84cecb08112a9ec5d7d8026a75a032f348c39a6ff2c94", "ja": "環、メイクのために準備したんだろ？\n今は遠慮しておくよ。", "zh": "环，你不是为了化妆准备好了吗？  \n现在还是先算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bb575f69b9f6fd0a4701fb0ebfa20170e4d5866a5c528207012a08552d0ed3f4", "ja": "じゃあ早速、自分達でメイクしてみようか。プロの人が\nついてるし、わからない事があったら何でも聞こうな！", "zh": "那就马上开始，自己试着化妆吧。专业人士会在旁边，有什么不懂的尽管问！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "234dcc4fd8a9b2e9b2b288c8cf46f2b386ffe331cb7b5b6dc78b20d682904cda", "ja": "まず道具を用意しないとだな。\nえーと、口紅にチークと……。", "zh": "得先准备好工具才行呢。\n我想想，口红还有腮红……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "26516e5ca56ae66b71428e3b2f35c69bd086431b0eeeacd986188054e0667261", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nそういうのは、最後につかうやつだよ？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n那些东西，是最后才用的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "fafd86f727bf77ac9922392a6e85e7340c23b66dab1ee58d49278218577cc05b", "ja": "まずはベースメイクをするから、乳液とかクリーム、\nあとは下地と、ファンデーションだよ！", "zh": "先要化底妆，所以要用乳液和面霜，\n然后是妆前乳和粉底哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "085967aec5a9571cc57757e360cffbdfbebb105e156ebd5598222812263c3e3a", "ja": "気になるところにコンシーラーをひいて、\nリップとかチークは、そのあと！", "zh": "在在意的地方涂上遮瑕膏，\n唇膏和腮红之类的要放到之后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1015_makesan", "source_sha256": "e95f28618e4769adb0c5eb172c37777789876889bd600f23c4519b0365552a43", "ja": "まあ……育ちゃん、大正解です！\nよく勉強してるんですね～！", "zh": "嗯……育，完全正确！\n你学习得很认真呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "877edc9557cad278fa41c4e0b54bd9afa26438a5f1be88e4b167f903961fe9bf", "ja": "な、なるほど。育、ありがとう。\n育は、メイクに詳しいんだな……。", "zh": "原、原来如此。育，谢谢你。\n育对化妆很了解啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "55a100b7c3432084bb694bb959da6f2e9673a5a9721e429d0465c82827f73bc2", "ja": "うん！　おかあさんがお化粧してるところ、\nわたし、いつもそばで見てるんだ♪", "zh": "嗯！我总是在妈妈化妆的时候，待在旁边看着她♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1018_makesan", "source_sha256": "6cc74fc0b995e2489790ecc219cb6f303418a391f145f8811031a834d976c6fc", "ja": "そうね。やっぱりみんな、メイクは\nお母さんに教えてもらう事が多いかしら。", "zh": "是啊。果然大家大多都是\n向妈妈请教化妆的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "ae7580fd9b41a065bda8ff8cec47e505fd7724e4723089a9e88bc431f09ecdff", "ja": "あ……！\nえ、えっと、あの……。", "zh": "啊……！\n那、那个……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0e243c26d7449e3aa977ab22957d523d5bb2754083d9d835336795f5eb080e71", "ja": "（桃子、少し気にしてるみたいだな。\nよし、ここは話題を変えて……）", "zh": "（桃子好像有点在意啊。好，这里就换个话题吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "25777780fa44a388b6ccb163b6e72e012d132b10252b137dbca768c769ebcea3", "ja": "ももこ、みてみて～！　このハサミ、かっこいいぞ！\nでもこれって、カミ切れるのかな……？", "zh": "桃子，快看快看～！这把剪刀好帅气啊！\n不过这个，真的能剪纸吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "0d2c044d2b2b1d5dd909684799bf5d665327400bc38ca31e682573604838f6d5", "ja": "髪？　今日は髪はいじらないと思うけど……あっ、環！\nそれはビューラーだから、髪をはさんじゃダメ！", "zh": "头发？今天应该不会弄头发吧……啊，环！\n那个是睫毛夹，可不能夹头发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "e00cdb24cfc6b73ab15bf6b163cfbaf5267735171ae668d77152ef8e9398ab20", "ja": "そうなの？　これで紙を切ったら、トラとか\nサメとか、かっこいい形になりそうなのに……。", "zh": "是这样吗？要是用这个剪纸的话，感觉能剪出老虎、鲨鱼之类的帅气形状……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "0e7ce218c67387b63f38cd335e48f929d052309c4612d5e7dcfbbe74902f4a17", "ja": "もしかして、環……カミって、折り紙とかの\n紙のことを言ってたの？　まったくもう……。", "zh": "难道说，环……你说的“纸”，是指折纸之类的纸吗？真是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "21938817723c066740bd587520e246f0c49ca22c7ebac2e1554c5e04b9b82cd1", "ja": "はぁ。これは、桃子じゃ無理かも……。\n育、環にイチから教えるから、手伝って。", "zh": "唉。这下桃子可能真的做不到……育，桃子会从头教环的，你来帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "a7c5da8d889995125f43167b13817be076968279aee9e1208da366d2d0d4f327", "ja": "う、うん。わかった！", "zh": "嗯、嗯。我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "48ccf4f863e91c322e1d1e74ead653d53a8cece72326f31d4e26ad1edd5c7780", "ja": "（いい感じに話が変わったな。内容は、いつも\nどおりだったけど……ファインプレーだぞ、環！）", "zh": "（话题转得不错啊。内容虽然一如既往……但这可是精彩表现啊，环！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "413e043e50918253e19e0b4ab6039809bbe36ab7a64b320b2ca21ecd840a3611", "ja": "ふう。……メイクできたよ、お兄ちゃん！\nこんな感じでどう？", "zh": "呼。……化好妆了哦，哥哥！\n这样感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "52d747e10429e49da49d34d7dcbc8797a067b8f940138777bff40b42f29df6f4", "ja": "うん、すごく可愛いぞ、桃子！\n育も、自然な感じで仕上がってるな！", "zh": "嗯，非常可爱哦，桃子！\n育也化得非常自然呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1032_030iku", "source_sha256": "28f6498cc01fcfc527aad433054edb6b66c48c0029f5cce445a5e6ef935a4551", "ja": "えへへ……♪　ありがとう、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪谢谢你，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1033_040tam", "source_sha256": "0bc93393518bc5798d8b9cf138f24bd16b926bb577051d3053d0886790fe37c4", "ja": "おやぶーん！\nたまきもできたぞ～！", "zh": "老大——！\n环也做好了哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "d2b671f77936a9c60ffa086744da35bd60a03ac8d9beaee867e0179361a3b4da", "ja": "お、環！　これは……。", "zh": "哦，环！这是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1035_makesan", "source_sha256": "8990a9a1d9a4a05f5fc1bf14b802b271638d234fd0f857c2b939ff83899cf2a7", "ja": "環ちゃん、メイク映えしますね～。\n年齢の割に、スタイルが良いせいでしょうか？", "zh": "环，上妆很显气色呢～  \n是因为年纪不大，身材却很好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1036_makesan", "source_sha256": "3c6d6988f205d4e4c308ff8fa1a99152f0eeef087f78f0e07b2a28eb6bbaee22", "ja": "軽く目元にラインを引いただけで、顔立ちが\nくっきりして、ぐっと大人っぽくなるんですよ！", "zh": "只是在眼睛周围轻轻描了几笔，五官就变得更加鲜明，看起来也一下子成熟多了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1037_049mom", "source_sha256": "92ab7ad5b5858c2c2e7e442239480011023b12edc5c4b476e4d4c00c8d2d8cf6", "ja": "たしかに、いつもよりちょっと大人っぽいよね。\n目もぱっちりしてるし……。", "zh": "确实，比平时稍微成熟一点呢。\n眼睛也显得更大更有神了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "a2ecdd3a095b271295d4b9388cd422b8f0712d6d5533f9aafd5ef900c8a13bf0", "ja": "はあ……。\n環ってば……ホント、ずるいんだから……。", "zh": "哈啊……环真是的……真的太狡猾了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1039_040tam", "source_sha256": "0d1b7f51e0473b2a976598e285f11d28f54663ae08e120b83249db910c080b6f", "ja": "えー！？　たまき、ずるはしてないぞー！？\nあ、メイクさんには、手伝ってもらったけど……。", "zh": "诶——！？环才没有耍赖呢——！？\n啊，不过化妆师确实帮了点忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1040_049mom", "source_sha256": "6a429e3cd85b0922b0353e18ca26ed25f814cf2ba9d23d9b20095c9b96cd05d8", "ja": "そういう意味じゃなくって……もう。\nほら、育もなにか言ってあげたら？", "zh": "不是那个意思……真是的。\n那个，育，你也说点什么吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1041_030iku", "source_sha256": "6fafd30b3dc91ecde7f917c2792686d794058c3def5291efba33163475fbf800", "ja": "え？　う、うん。環ちゃん、大人っぽいよね。\n……。", "zh": "诶？呃、嗯。小环很有大人风范呢。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "fe6e46628631ffa2c2fcf2e32bd7e77f63b6f2eac76442cafc1d9fb55ee94b99", "ja": "（育……何か気にしてるみたいだな。本人達が\n上手くやれている間は、口出しを控えたいけど……）", "zh": "（育……好像在介意什么。只要她们自己还能顺利应对，我本来想先不插手，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0152_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_03_1043_p", "source_sha256": "ba7fcf2063949b584b1442e7f64a698abf0073b72e0b9e4ea417521376ef95e8", "ja": "（もう少し、様子を見てみるか……）", "zh": "（再观察一会儿吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
